export const HTML = "<header class=\"cover bleed\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Brand book · v1.0 · 31 Oct 2026</div><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-primary-white-on-green.webp\" alt=\"JAOSAMUT จ้าวสมุทร Thai Seafood\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"sub\"><b>Tastes like Thailand. Priced for every day.</b><br>Rasa macam di Thailand. Harga untuk setiap hari.</p><nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"Sections\"><a href=\"#story\">01 Story</a><a href=\"#mark\">02 Mark</a><a href=\"#construction\">03 Construction</a><a href=\"#lockups\">04 Lockups</a><a href=\"#wordmark\">05 Wordmark</a><a href=\"#mnemonic\">06 Mnemonic</a><a href=\"#colour\">07 Colour</a><a href=\"#type\">08 Type</a><a href=\"#voice\">09 Voice</a><a href=\"#motion\">10 Motion</a><a href=\"#art\">11 Art direction</a><a href=\"#merch\">12 Merch</a><a href=\"#monogram\">13 Pattern</a><a href=\"#mascot\">14 Khao Hom</a></nav></header><section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"story\"><div class=\"secnum\">01</div><h2>Story</h2><p class=\"lead\">Cyberjaya has Thai restaurants. It does not have a Thai seafood house.</p>\n<div class=\"grid2\">\n <div><p class=\"mini\">WHAT WE ARE</p><p><b>JAOSAMUT</b>, จ้าวสมุทร, is \"King of the Ocean\": Thai seafood, cooked by Thai people, at a price that doesn't ask permission. The owner is from Nonthaburi, wrote every recipe and still cooks.</p></div>\n <div><p class=\"mini\">POSITIONING</p><p>For students, office workers and families in Cyberjaya who want food with real flavour, Jaosamut is the Thai seafood house where the tom yam is built on seafood the way it is in Thailand.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pillars\">\n <div><span>01</span><b>King of the Ocean</b>Seafood is the specialism, not a menu section.</div>\n <div><span>02</span><b>Thai hands, Thai recipes</b>A Thai owner who still cooks. Stated as fact.</div>\n <div><span>03</span><b>Grown here, cooked here</b>Live herbs from the wall. Green means fresh.</div>\n <div><span>04</span><b>Worth it, not cheap</b>Honest portions, no surprises on the bill.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"aud\"><div><b>Tech office workers</b>Weekday lunch. Speed and certainty, a set lunch decided in ten seconds.</div>\n<div><b>University students</b>All week. Phone-first, price-aware, will photograph anything good.</div>\n<div><b>Local families</b>Evenings and weekends. Sharing plates, warmth, clear dietary signalling.</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"mark\"><div class=\"secnum\">02</div><h2>The mark</h2><p class=\"lead\">A chef's hand tossing a wok on high heat. The flames rise and curl like breaking waves, and the sea runs underneath.</p>\n<div class=\"cards3\"><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-symbol-green.webp\" alt=\"Jaosamut symbol\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Full colour</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#33A02C\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-symbol-white-on-green.webp\" alt=\"Jaosamut symbol reversed\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Reversed</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-symbol-black.webp\" alt=\"Jaosamut symbol one colour\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>One colour</figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"mark-how\"><p class=\"mini\">HOW THE MARK WORKS: GET IT RIGHT FIRST TIME</p>\n<p class=\"mark-read\"><b>The idea:</b> two truths in one shape. <b>Thai hands</b> (the owner cooking, wok hei) and <b>the ocean</b> (เจ้าสมุทร, King of the Ocean): the flames are waves.</p>\n<ul class=\"mark-parts\"><li><span>Ground</span> none; Pandan Green #33A02C on white, white on green, or black</li>\n<li><span>Marks</span> traced vector paths: fist, handle, wok, three flame-waves, two sea waves</li>\n<li><span>Small cut</span> symbol-small closes the thinnest flame gaps; use it at 48 px and below</li>\n<li><span>Clear space</span> ≥ 25% of the symbol width on every side</li>\n<li><span>Min size</span> 32 px / 10 mm. Below that, use the JS monogram</li></ul>\n<pre class=\"code\">/* THE MARK IS TRACED, NOT DRAWN FROM A FORMULA.\n   The SVG files ARE the spec: jaosamut-symbol-{green|white-on-green|black}.svg\n   Source: ChatGPT concept C → vtracer (binary, spline) → normalised\n   Score vs reference: DSSIM 0.0077 (target &lt; 0.01)\n   Fills are hardcoded hex. No CSS-variable fills, no &lt;mask&gt;. */</pre></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"construction\"><div class=\"secnum\">03</div><h2>Construction</h2><p class=\"lead\">One unit, x, governs the spacing: the cap height of JAOSAMUT.</p>\n<div class=\"wide\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-construction.webp\" alt=\"Primary logo construction with clear space\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Clear space</th><th>Minimum, screen</th><th>Minimum, print</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Primary</td><td>½x</td><td>160 px wide</td><td>30 mm wide</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Stacked</td><td>½x</td><td>110 px wide</td><td>22 mm wide</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Badge</td><td>10% of diameter</td><td>72 px</td><td>18 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Wordmark</td><td>½x</td><td>120 px wide</td><td>25 mm wide</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Symbol</td><td>25% of width</td><td>32 px (small cut ≤ 48 px)</td><td>10 mm</td></tr>\n<tr><td>JS monogram</td><td>15% of width</td><td>16 px</td><td>6 mm</td></tr></tbody></table></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"lockups\"><div class=\"secnum\">04</div><h2>Lockups</h2><p class=\"lead\">Fixed arrangements of symbol and name. They are never re-spaced or rebuilt by hand.</p>\n<div class=\"cards3\"><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-primary-green.webp\" alt=\"Primary logo\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Primary · signboard, web, menu cover</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-stacked-green.webp\" alt=\"Stacked logo\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Stacked · bags, social, door vinyl</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-badge-green.webp\" alt=\"Badge logo\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Badge · stamp, seal sticker, receipt</figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"cards3\"><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#33A02C\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-primary-white-on-green.webp\" alt=\"Primary logo reversed\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Primary reversed</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#33A02C\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-stacked-white-on-green.webp\" alt=\"Stacked logo reversed\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Stacked reversed</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#33A02C\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-badge-white-on-green.webp\" alt=\"Badge reversed\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Badge reversed</figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"cards3\"><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-primary-black.webp\" alt=\"Primary one colour\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Primary · one colour</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-stacked-black.webp\" alt=\"Stacked one colour\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Stacked · one colour</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-badge-black.webp\" alt=\"Badge one colour\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Badge · one colour (rubber stamp)</figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"wordmark\"><div class=\"secnum\">05</div><h2>Custom wordmark</h2><p class=\"lead\">JAOSAMUT in Archivo Black, with one signature detail: the O is a wok, with a flame curling out of it.</p>\n<div class=\"wide\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-wordmark-green.webp\" alt=\"JAOSAMUT wordmark\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ul class=\"rules\"><li>The Thai name จ้าวสมุทร sits above, in Kanit SemiBold, at 34% of the wordmark size.</li>\n<li>The wok O appears in every version that carries the name, including the badge ring.</li>\n<li>Use the locked artwork only. Never retype JAOSAMUT, even in Archivo Black: the wok O only exists in the files.</li>\n<li>Tracking −2%. Never outline, italicise or add effects.</li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"mnemonic\"><div class=\"secnum\">06</div><h2>Mnemonic system</h2><p class=\"lead\">Pieces of the identity that work on their own, once people know the brand.</p>\n<div class=\"cards3\"><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-symbol-alt-js-flame-green.webp\" alt=\"JS in the flame\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>JS in the flame · signature mark<small>Stickers, merch, pattern, social. Never beside the main logo.</small></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/jaosamut-monogram-green.webp\" alt=\"JS monogram\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>JS monogram · smallest sizes<small>Favicon, embroidery, pattern unit.</small></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><div class=\"kh-loader\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Loading\"><div class=\"kh-cat\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/run-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/run-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/run-3.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/run-4.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"kh-fish\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/fish-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/fish-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></div><figcaption>Khao Hom loader · waiting moments<small>App and web loading screens. See Motion.</small></figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"colour\"><div class=\"secnum\">07</div><h2>Colour</h2><p class=\"lead\">Fresh Market: white ground, Kaffir Ink text, Pandan Green as the signature, a squeeze of lime. Gold is banned.</p>\n<div class=\"swatches\"><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;color:#0C2B18\"><b>White</b><span>#FFFFFF</span><small>Ground</small></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#EEF5E6;color:#0C2B18\"><b>Herb Mist</b><span>#EEF5E6</span><small>Panels, quiet fills</small></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#0C2B18;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>Kaffir Ink</b><span>#0C2B18</span><small>All text. Never pure black</small></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#33A02C;color:#0C2B18\"><b>Pandan Green</b><span>#33A02C</span><small>Signature: logo, header, signboard</small></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#23751D;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>Pandan Deep</b><span>#23751D</span><small>Buttons, links, green text</small></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#C9EC6B;color:#0C2B18\"><b>Lime Zest</b><span>#C9EC6B</span><small>Pop: SIGNATURE, NEW. Fill only</small></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#C4340B;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>Prik Chili</b><span>#C4340B</span><small>Spice LEVEL, errors. ~2%</small></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#9A6700;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>Tamarind</b><span>#9A6700</span><small>Staff screens only: warnings</small></div></div>\n<div class=\"ratio\"><span style=\"flex:58;background:#FFFFFF\"></span><span style=\"flex:20;background:#0C2B18\"></span><span style=\"flex:12;background:#33A02C\"></span><span style=\"flex:8;background:#C9EC6B\"></span><span style=\"flex:2;background:#C4340B\"></span></div>\n<p class=\"mini\">USAGE · 58 WHITE · 20 INK · 12 GREEN · 8 LIME · 2 CHILI</p>\n<table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>Pair</th><th>Contrast</th><th>Use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Kaffir Ink on White</td><td>16.1 : 1</td><td>All text (AAA)</td></tr><tr><td>Ink Soft on White</td><td>6.97 : 1</td><td>Secondary text (AA)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>White on Pandan Deep</td><td>5.78 : 1</td><td>Buttons (AA)</td></tr><tr><td>White on Pandan Green</td><td>3.38 : 1</td><td>Large text and logo only</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Kaffir Ink on Lime Zest</td><td>11.4 : 1</td><td>Chips (AAA)</td></tr><tr><td>Prik Chili on White</td><td>5.46 : 1</td><td>Spice level, errors (AA)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3>Drop hues: Thai market</h3><p class=\"lead small\">Used one at a time for limited editions, festive menus and campaigns. Never in the logo, never two at once.</p>\n<div class=\"swatches four\"><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#D2381E;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>Prik Kee Noo (bird's-eye chili)</b><span>#D2381E</span></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#E3A21A;color:#0C2B18\"><b>Khamin (turmeric)</b><span>#E3A21A</span></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#2E4FA3;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>Dok Anchan (butterfly pea)</b><span>#2E4FA3</span></div><div class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#7B4A2B;color:#FFFFFF\"><b>Makham (tamarind)</b><span>#7B4A2B</span></div></div>\n<h3>Retired</h3><p class=\"lead small\">v1.0 grounds Rice Paper #F1F4EC and Steam #E5EBDD are replaced by White and Herb Mist from 31 Oct 2026. Kaffir Ink, Pandan Green and Prik Chili continue.</p></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"type\"><div class=\"secnum\">08</div><h2>Typography</h2><p class=\"lead\">Four faces, one job each. On any screen, Archivo Black appears at most once.</p>\n<div class=\"type-row\"><span class=\"role\">Display · Archivo Black</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--display);font-size:40px;line-height:1\">Thai seafood. Come eat.</span></div>\n<div class=\"type-row\"><span class=\"role\">Body · IBM Plex Sans</span><span style=\"font-size:17px\"><b>Tom Yam Talay</b> · Prawn, squid, mussel, fish, lemongrass, lime.</span></div>\n<div class=\"type-row\"><span class=\"role\">Data · IBM Plex Mono</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.14em\">18.90 · LEVEL 2 · TABLE 7 · HOW WAS IT?</span></div>\n<div class=\"type-row\"><span class=\"role\">Thai · Kanit</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--thai);font-weight:600;font-size:28px\">จ้าวสมุทร</span></div>\n<div class=\"dd\"><div class=\"do\"><b>Do</b><ul><li>Prices as 18.90 in mono on menus; RM 18.90 at payment</li><li>Sentence case for headlines</li><li>Two Latin faces per piece (mono for numbers doesn't count)</li></ul></div><div class=\"dont\"><b>Don't</b><ul><li>Dot leaders between dish and price</li><li>Retyping JAOSAMUT</li><li>Archivo Black for body text</li><li>Thai-imitation Latin lettering</li></ul></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"voice\"><div class=\"secnum\">09</div><h2>Voice</h2><p class=\"lead\">The uncle who watches your first bite: direct, proud, warm, honest. Signature line: How was it?</p>\n<div class=\"tagline\"><p class=\"mini\">OFFICIAL TAGLINE</p><p class=\"tl\">Tastes like Thailand. Priced for every day.</p><p class=\"tlbm\">BM: Rasa macam di Thailand. Harga untuk setiap hari.</p><p class=\"small\">Use it on packaging, the staff polo back, menu covers, signage support panels and social. It sells real Thai taste first and everyday value second; never \"murah\" or \"cheapest\".</p></div>\n<table class=\"tbl voice\"><thead><tr><th>Not this</th><th>This</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Indulge in our exquisite authentic Thai culinary experience!!!</td><td>Thai seafood. Thai recipes. Thai chef. Come eat.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Our signature Tom Yum is a must-try you cannot miss!</td><td>Tom Yam Talay. Prawn, squid, mussel, fish. This is the one we're known for.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sorry for the inconvenience caused.</td><td>You waited too long and that's on us. Come back and ask for me.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Your order has been processed successfully.</td><td>Order's in. Wok's on.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"motion\"><div class=\"secnum\">10</div><h2>Motion</h2><p class=\"lead\">Quick, warm and purposeful. Motion confirms an action. It never decorates.</p>\n<table class=\"tbl\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>Fast</td><td>120 ms</td><td>Taps, toggles, chips</td></tr><tr><td>Base</td><td>200 ms</td><td>Sheets, drawers, menus</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Reveal</td><td>700 ms, rise 14 px</td><td>Sections and cards entering, light stagger</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Easing</td><td>cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)</td><td>Everything</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mark entry</td><td>scale .92 → 1, 300 ms</td><td>Splash screen. Never spin or bounce the logo</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Loader</td><td>4-frame run at 8 fps</td><td>Khao Hom chasing a fish; any wait over 400 ms</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Reduced motion</td><td>fade only</td><td>Respect prefers-reduced-motion everywhere; the loader shows a still frame</td></tr></tbody></table></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"art\"><div class=\"secnum\">11</div><h2>Art direction</h2><p class=\"lead\">A real place with real Thai hands. Every dish is photographed for digital; seafood always visible.</p>\n<div class=\"dd\"><div class=\"do\"><b>Do</b><ul><li>Daylight from the side, mid-morning or mid-afternoon</li><li>45° and top-down, crop tight, fill the frame</li><li>Steam, char, chilli oil, hands, the owner and chef</li><li>Every dish photographed for the app and delivery platforms</li><li>Seafood visible on top; one live herb from the wall</li></ul></div><div class=\"dont\"><b>Don't</b><ul><li>On-camera flash</li><li>Over-saturated greens and oranges, heavy filters, vignettes</li><li>Stock or AI-generated food photos</li><li>Shooting a dish not plated to standard</li><li>Styling that makes portions look bigger than served</li></ul></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"merch\"><div class=\"secnum\">12</div><h2>Uniform, takeaway &amp; merch</h2><p class=\"lead\">Tastes like Thailand. Priced for every day. Every surface says it, from the staff polo to the chopstick sleeve.</p>\n<figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"/brand/mockups/jaosamut-uniform.jpg\" alt=\"Jaosamut staff polos: men's short sleeve and women's long sleeve, front and back\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>Staff uniform</b> · Kaffir Ink pique polo, Pandan Green collar · front: primary lockup embroidered on the left chest, dark placket · cuffs: Pandan Green with the Wok Canvas monogram woven in · back: stacked logo with จ้าวสมุทร (no descriptor), tagline right underneath on the upper back · men short sleeve, women long sleeve with optional plain tudung</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"/brand/mockups/jaosamut-takeaway-set.jpg\" alt=\"Jaosamut takeaway set\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>Takeaway set</b> · kraft bag and meal box with one-colour stamps · the round badge as the only sticker (branding only, no per-dish labels) · Wok Canvas cup sleeve · tagline on bag, cup and rider bag · chopstick sleeve: dark green block with white monogram, white body, dark green wordmark, Khao Hom</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"/brand/mockups/jaosamut-aprons-caps.jpg\" alt=\"Jaosamut kitchen apron, owner's green apron, and cap front and back\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>Aprons &amp; cap</b> · kitchen apron in Kaffir Ink and the owner's one green apron: stacked logo embroidered on the bib, tagline above the hem · cap: wok symbol embroidered on the front, wordmark above the back strap</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"/brand/mockups/jaosamut-card-tag.jpg\" alt=\"Jaosamut loyalty card front and back, and a numbered merch drop tag\" class=\"\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>Loyalty card &amp; drop tag</b> · matte Kaffir Ink PVC card: wordmark, MEMBER, JS in the flame, member number and cashback; back: 8 paw-print stamps = 1 signature dish · Dok Anchan drop tag: JS in the flame; back: tagline and Khao Hom</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"merch-grid\">\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 240\" class=\"merch\"><rect width=\"340\" height=\"240\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#F4F6F1\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"80\" r=\"62\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><image href=\"/brand/jaosamut-badge-green.webp\" x=\"22\" y=\"22\" width=\"116\" height=\"116\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" rx=\"75\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><image href=\"/brand/mascot/khao-hom-2-cheeky.webp\" x=\"178\" y=\"26\" width=\"134\" height=\"140\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"190\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#33A02C\"/><image href=\"/brand/jaosamut-symbol-alt-js-flame-white.webp\" x=\"58\" y=\"158\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"178\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#0C2B18\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"10\" letter-spacing=\"1\" fill=\"#C9EC6B\">PRICED FOR EVERY DAY.</text></svg><figcaption>Brand stickers · badge, Khao Hom, JS</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" class=\"merch\"><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"92\" fill=\"#2B2F2C\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"86\" fill=\"#33A02C\"/><image href=\"/brand/jaosamut-symbol-alt-js-flame-white.webp\" x=\"44\" y=\"44\" width=\"132\" height=\"132\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\"/></svg><figcaption>Enamel pin · black nickel, no gold</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"rules\"><li>Stickers carry branding only. No per-dish labels: one seal design keeps print costs down.</li><li>Embroider anything worn daily; screen-print backs. No gold foil, thread or metal.</li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"monogram\"><div class=\"secnum\">13</div><h2>Monogram &amp; pattern</h2><p class=\"lead\">The Wok Canvas: a two-by-two checkerboard of the symbol and JS. It makes plain surfaces recognisable.</p>\n<div class=\"cards3\"><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/pattern/wok-canvas-fresh-preview.webp\" alt=\"Wok Canvas fresh\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Canvas Fresh<small>Bags, menu back, packaging</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/pattern/wok-canvas-dark-preview.webp\" alt=\"Wok Canvas dark\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Canvas Dark<small>Apron hems, collar linings</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/pattern/wok-canvas-tonal-preview.webp\" alt=\"Wok Canvas tonal\" class=\"art\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Canvas Tonal<small>Subtle surfaces, felt more than seen</small></figcaption></figure></div>\n<ul class=\"rules\"><li>Tile 120 mm at print reference. Symbol and JS sit on alternate diagonals; never two alike side by side.</li>\n<li>Empty surfaces only: never behind text, never on the signboard, never on the food side of packaging.</li>\n<li>Roughly one in four brand surfaces, maximum. The badge is the seal: ration it to receipts, seals and member cards.</li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"reveal wrap\" id=\"mascot\"><div class=\"secnum\">14</div><h2>Khao Hom ข้าวหอม</h2><p class=\"lead\">Our chef cat, named after fragrant rice. A ginger British Shorthair with a small hat and both ears showing. He loves fish, obviously.</p>\n<div class=\"cards3\"><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/khao-hom-1-proud.webp\" alt=\"Proud little chef\" class=\"art cat\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Proud little chef<small>Website hero, menu, shopfront</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/khao-hom-2-cheeky.webp\" alt=\"Cheeky &amp; hungry\" class=\"art cat\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Cheeky &amp; hungry<small>Memes, stickers, promos</small></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/brand/mascot/khao-hom-3-host.webp\" alt=\"Warm host\" class=\"art cat\" style=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Warm host<small>How was it?, reservations, kids' menu</small></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"dd\"><div class=\"do\"><b>Do</b><ul><li>Stickers, memes, the loader, the kids' menu, social stories</li><li>Let him chase fish: it's his whole personality</li><li>Keep his Pandan Green neckerchief and small hat</li></ul></div><div class=\"dont\"><b>Don't</b><ul><li>Put him in or next to the logo</li><li>Use him on invoices, e-invoices or formal notices</li><li>Redraw him off-model or make him look like any famous cartoon cat</li></ul></div></div></section>\n<footer class=\"foot\">JAOSAMUT — THAI SEAFOOD · จ้าวสมุทร · CYBERJAYA · HOW WAS IT?</footer>"
